[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631903749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102341#issuecomment-2631903749","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102341","id":2631903749,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c36oF","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T19:37:27Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T19:44:36Z","body":"Presumably we still want the feature; however, the code could be implemented a little differently to match the behaviour of our implementation.\r\n\r\n* Metal for iOS has a lower device requirement than MoltenVK, so if Metal fails, MoltenVK will fail too; therefore, the feature should not be necessary for iOS\r\n* Metal is not available or compiled into x86_64 binaries, so it wouldn't even try to initialise a Metal driver; therefore, fallback should always occur.\r\n* All Apple Silicon Macs support Metal, so it should never need to fallback to Vulkan, meaning the feature is not required for Apple Silicon (arm64 builds)\r\n\r\nIn other words,\r\n\r\n- Remove implementation for iOS\r\n- Change implementation for macOS to something like:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nrendering_driver = p_rendering_driver;\r\n\r\n#if defined(RD_ENABLED)\r\n#if defined(VULKAN_ENABLED)\r\n#if defined(__x86_64__)\r\n\tbool fallback_to_vulkan = GLOBAL_GET(\"rendering/rendering_device/fallback_to_vulkan\");\r\n\t// Metal rendering driver not available on Intel\r\n\tif (fallback_to_vulkan && rendering_driver == \"metal\") {\r\n\t\trendering_driver = \"vulkan\";\r\n\t\tOS::get_singleton()->set_current_rendering_driver_name(rendering_driver);\r\n\t}\r\n#endif\r\n\r\n\tif (rendering_driver == \"vulkan\") {\r\n...\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631903749/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2632622596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102341#issuecomment-2632622596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102341","id":2632622596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c6qIE","user":{"login":"SheepYhangCN","id":44539204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTM5MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44539204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN","html_url":"https://github.com/SheepYhangCN","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T02:29:56Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T02:29:56Z","body":"All fixed I think","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2632622596/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2645983539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102341#issuecomment-2645983539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102341","id":2645983539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dtoEz","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-08T23:38:17Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T23:38:17Z","body":"I'm wondering if we should get this in for `4.4`, since the Metal rendering driver was made the default already. Otherwise, projects will stop working on Intel Macs by default if they use Forward+ or Mobile.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2645983539/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2646601598","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102341#issuecomment-2646601598","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102341","id":2646601598,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dv-9-","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-09T21:08:02Z","updated_at":"2025-02-09T21:08:02Z","body":"@Calinou I agree – we don't want to break or alienate users on Intel hardware. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2646601598/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647779193","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102341#issuecomment-2647779193","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102341","id":2647779193,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d0ed5","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T11:58:48Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T11:58:48Z","body":"For the reference, this change should not be necessary in normal conditions:\r\n- If project is edited/exported from Apple Silicon editor, it won't save `metal` in the `project.godot` since it default value and default values are omitted, so `x86_64` executable will use its default (`vulkan`) without any additional checks.\r\n- If you try to force Metal render on x86_64 with command line argument (`--rendering-driver metal`), it will fail during argument validation in the `Main` and never get to this code.\r\n- But it is possible to manually edit `project.godot`, and explicitly specify `metal`, and this code will work as expected.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647779193/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647836924","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102341#issuecomment-2647836924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102341","id":2647836924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d0sj8","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T12:24:25Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T12:24:25Z","body":"I squashed the commits and clarified in the docs that this is only for macOS x86_64.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647836924/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}